    <circle cx="650" cy="40" r="1.5" fill="#8fd7ff" opacity="0.5" />

    <!-- Greenwich Royal Observatory Motif -->
    <g transform="translate(100, 110)">
      <path d="M0 40 A30 30 0 0 1 60 40 Z" fill="#1b536e" />
      <rect x="10" y="40" width="40" height="40" fill="#164d68" />
      <circle cx="30" cy="25" r="5" fill="#36c7b5" />
    </g>

    <!-- Signal Hill Hilltop Curve -->
    <path d="M 450 185 Q 600 110 750 185 Z" fill="#164d68" opacity="0.8" />

    <!-- Cabot Tower Silhouette (St. John's, Signal Hill) -->
    <g transform="translate(600, 70)">
      <rect x="15" y="30" width="30" height="70" fill="#1b536e" />
      <rect x="22" y="10" width="16" height="20" fill="#12455d" />
      <line x1="30" y1="0" x2="30" y2="10" stroke="#36c7b5" stroke-width="2" />
    </g>

    <rect x="0" y="185" width="800" height="15" fill="#071b26" />
    <line x1="0" y1="185" x2="800" y2="185" stroke="#36c7b5" stroke-width="2" />
  </svg>
</section>

<!-- TIME DIFFERENCE MECHANICS -->
<section class="method-section" id="time-difference" aria-labelledby="time-diff-heading">
  <div class="method-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Mathematical Mechanics</p>
    <h2 id="time-diff-heading">Understanding the -2.5 Hour Fractional Difference</h2>
    <p>
      The time gap between Greenwich Mean Time (UTC+0) and Newfoundland Daylight Time (UTC-2:30) is calculated by subtracting 2 hours and 30 minutes from the GMT clock.
    </p>
    <p>
      When it is 12:00 PM (Noon) GMT in London, local time in St. John's or Corner Brook is 9:30 AM NDT. When GMT reaches 2:30 PM, Newfoundland reaches 12:00 PM (Noon) NDT on the same calendar day.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 700px; padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px;">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 600 180" width="100%" height="auto" style="display: block;">
      <rect width="600" height="180" fill="#0c354a" rx="8" />
      <g transform="translate(120, 90)">
        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="50" fill="#12455d" stroke="#2f6278" stroke-width="3" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-30" stroke="#f4fbff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="20" y2="0" stroke="#8fd7ff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <text x="0" y="70" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="14" fill="#f4fbff" text-anchor="middle">GMT (UTC+0)</text>
      </g>
      <g transform="translate(300, 90)">
        <text x="0" y="8" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="28" fill="#36c7b5" text-anchor="middle">→</text>
        <rect x="-55" y="-30" width="110" height="24" rx="12" fill="#1b536e" />
        <text x="0" y="-14" font-family="'Manrope', sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="800" fill="#36c7b5" text-anchor="middle">-2.5 HOURS</text>
      </g>
      <g transform="translate(480, 90)">
        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="50" fill="#12455d" stroke="#36c7b5" stroke-width="3" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="-18" y2="-18" stroke="#f4fbff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="24" stroke="#36c7b5" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <text x="0" y="70" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="14" fill="#f4fbff" text-anchor="middle">NDT (UTC-2:30)</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="method-grid">
    <article class="method-card">
      <h3>Fractional Half-Hour Math</h3>
      <p>Subtracting 2.5 hours means top-of-the-hour GMT times map to half-past NDT times (e.g. 10:00 AM GMT = 7:30 AM NDT).</p>
    </article>
    <article class="method-card">
      <h3>Day Boundary Shifts</h3>
      <p>Early morning GMT timestamps (12:00 AM to 2:29 AM GMT) map to the prior evening in St. John's (9:30 PM to 11:59 PM NDT -1 day).</p>
    </article>
    <article class="method-card">
      <h3>Prime Transatlantic Overlap</h3>
      <p>European late morning and early afternoon (11:30 AM to 5:00 PM GMT) align seamlessly with Newfoundland's core business hours (9:00 AM to 2:30 PM NDT).</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 24-HOUR CONVERSION TABLE -->
<section class="examples-section" id="conversion-chart" aria-labelledby="chart-heading">
  <div>
    <h2 id="chart-heading">Complete 24-Hour GMT to NDT Conversion Table</h2>
    <p>This reference chart converts every hour of Greenwich Mean Time (GMT) to Newfoundland Daylight Time (NDT).</p>

    <!-- Timeline Graphic -->
    <div style="margin: 2rem auto; overflow-x: auto; background: var(--panel); padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;">GMT to NDT Timeline Grid</h3>
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 900 100" width="900" height="100" style="display: block;">
        <rect x="20" y="40" width="860" height="16" fill="#1b536e" rx="8" />
        <g transform="translate(60, 48)">
          <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="7" fill="#36c7b5" />
          <text x="0" y="-18" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#bdd2dc" text-anchor="middle">6 AM GMT</text>
